diff --git a/saas/README.md b/saas/README.md
index 28b0891..46d89a2 100644
--- a/saas/README.md
+++ b/saas/README.md
@@ -40,6 +40,18 @@ bin/dev # You need to start the dev server in the same terminal session
 
 This will ask for your 1password authorization to read and set the environment variables that Stripe needs.
 
+### Billing
+
+Plans are defined in `app/models/plan.rb`. Stripe hosts checkout and the customer portal, and tells us about subscription changes through its webhooks. Each environment needs:
+
+* `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`
+* `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`: the signing secret of a webhook endpoint pointing at `/stripe/webhooks`, sending the `customer.subscription.*` events
+* `STRIPE_MONTHLY_V1_PRICE_ID` and `STRIPE_MONTHLY_EXTRA_STORAGE_V1_PRICE_ID`: the prices for Unlimited and Unlimited+
+
+Customers switch plans, update their payment details, and cancel in the customer portal, so its configuration must allow switching between those two prices.
+
+Support can comp accounts and override their usage at `/admin/accounts`.
+
 ### Stripe environments
 
 * [Development](https://dashboard.stripe.com/acct_1SdTFtRus34tgjsJ/test/dashboard)
